  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0 completes the runtime integration bundle with HealthChecks and OpenTelemetry, preserves 23 forwarded and 13 legacy facade identities, and removes five HTTP identities and PollyResilienceTransform under ADR-0004. Removed API callers must migrate to the HTTP/HTTP.Json or Polly leaves and recompile. PostgreSql and Testing remain separate packages.",
